      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si buscas al maestro Albar, ahora mismo no está,\npero me vienes que ni caíd<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa del cielo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Te reto a un combate, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.\n¡Sí, así de repente!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD060000005400650020007200650074006F0020006100200075006E00200063006F006D0062006100740065002C00200010000201000000002E000A00A1005300ED002C00200061007300ED00200064006500200072006500700065006E00740065002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quiero reflexionar un poco sobre mí misma,\naprovechando la ausencia del maestro Albar.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Avísame cuando te venga bien!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10041007600ED00730061006D00650020006300750061006E0064006F002000740065002000760065006E006700610020006200690065006E002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Quieres enfrentarte a mí? ¿O vienes por algún\nmovimiento +?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005100750069006500720065007300200065006E006600720065006E00740061007200740065002000610020006D00ED003F002000BF004F0020007600690065006E0065007300200070006F007200200061006C006700FA006E000A006D006F00760069006D00690065006E0074006F0020002B003F00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Combatamos!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006F006D0062006100740061006D006F007300210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lo segundo...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006F00200073006500670075006E0064006F002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En realidad ya me iba",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E0020007200650061006C00690064006100640020007900610020006D006500200069006200610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Supongo que tienes una agenda muy apretada.\nIngenua de mí...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300750070006F006E0067006F00200071007500650020007400690065006E0065007300200075006E00610020006100670065006E006400610020006D00750079002000610070007200650074006100640061002E000A0049006E00670065006E007500610020006400650020006D00ED002E002E002E00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Muéstrame la fuerza que te ha llevado a alcanzar\nel rango más alto en los Juegos Z-A!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿List<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa para el combate?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF004C00690073007400100003110000FF0101006F00610020007000610072006100200065006C00200063006F006D0062006100740065003F00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Jo, a ver si va a ser cierto que eres <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂella Entrenador<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa\nmás fuerte de toda la ciudad.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No te llego ni a la suela del zapato...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F0020007400650020006C006C00650067006F0020006E0069002000610020006C00610020007300750065006C0061002000640065006C0020007A0061007000610074006F002E002E002E00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Siento que estoy atascada... No consigo mejorar.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300690065006E0074006F00200071007500650020006500730074006F0079002000610074006100730063006100640061002E002E002E0020004E006F00200063006F006E007300690067006F0020006D0065006A006F007200610072002E00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Soy una deshonra para el Círculo Justiciero...\n¡Una mancha en el expediente del maestro Albar!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Empiezo a pensar que no merezco estar aquí...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006D007000690065007A006F00200061002000700065006E00730061007200200071007500650020006E006F0020006D006500720065007A0063006F002000650073007400610072002000610071007500ED002E002E002E00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¡ROOO!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100A10052004F004F004F002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¡GOOO!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100A10047004F004F004F002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Oh, no! ¡Son los Hermanos Pangorristas!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004F0068002C0020006E006F0021002000A10053006F006E0020006C006F00730020004800650072006D0061006E006F0073002000500061006E0067006F0072007200690073007400610073002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Son dos Pangoro que se niegan a vivir en las\nzonas salvajes y causan estragos por la ciudad!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Son muy duros de pelar. Incluso el maestro Albar\nlas pasa canutas cuando tiene que ahuyentarlos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y cuando él no está, como es el caso, soy yo la\nencargada de mantener a salvo el dojo, así que...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Vas a tener que ayudarme!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100560061007300200061002000740065006E0065007200200071007500650020006100790075006400610072006D0065002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Sabía que no me fallarías, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100530061006200ED006100200071007500650020006E006F0020006D0065002000660061006C006C0061007200ED00610073002C00200010000201000000002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Pan?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00500061006E003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vosotros ya podéis iros. La puerta está por ahí.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F0073006F00740072006F007300200079006100200070006F006400E900690073002000690072006F0073002E0020004C00610020007000750065007200740061002000650073007400E100200070006F007200200061006800ED002E00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Maestro Albar!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D00610065007300740072006F00200041006C006200610072002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, Cecilia... ¿Qué hacían aquí esos\nPangoro?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD0600000010000201000000002C00200043006500630069006C00690061002E002E002E002000BF0051007500E9002000680061006300ED0061006E002000610071007500ED002000650073006F0073000A00500061006E0067006F0072006F003F00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Querían colarse en el dojo a hacer de las suyas,\n¡pero <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> y yo los hemos echado!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "He podido ver de cerca un fragmento de toda la\nfuerza que posee <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂella salvador<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa de nuestra ciudad.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 112
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A su lado soy un hazmerreír...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 3824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410020007300750020006C00610064006F00200073006F007900200075006E002000680061007A006D006500720072006500ED0072002E002E002E00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cecilia.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 3896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006500630069006C00690061002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Sí, maestro?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 3924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005300ED002C0020006D00610065007300740072006F003F00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si te faltara talento para el combate, no podrías\nhaberle seguido el ritmo a alguien como <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿЂélella.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 3960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es más, nunca me alejaría del dojo si creyera que\nno está en buenas manos contigo protegiéndolo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eres consciente de la diferencia que te separa\nde alguien con una fuerza superior a la tuya<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ny eso te honra como luchadora.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 130
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tienes potencial para volverte mucho más fuerte.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLa próxima vez que vengan por aquí los Pangoro,\ncuento con tu ayuda para ahuyentarlos, ¿hecho?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 151
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Será un placer, maestro!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 4944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100530065007200E100200075006E00200070006C0061006300650072002C0020006D00610065007300740072006F002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gracias por todo, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>. ¡Te debo una!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700720061006300690061007300200070006F007200200074006F0064006F002C00200010000201000000002E002000A1005400650020006400650062006F00200075006E0061002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    }
